@startuml sequence-digitalizer-formulas-service
!include elvira.iuml
' =============================================================================
' What: the formulas stage on equation-service: the ledger plans jobs only for
'       leaf batches that have regions to re-read (formulas, tables), sends
'       their crops as fractions of the cleaned page, and applies the answers
'       through the orchestrator's own guards (fix_latex,
'       looks_hallucinated), so the quality gate counts rejections the same
'       way; a region an operator decided meanwhile keeps the operator's text.
' Kind: UML sequence diagram, one batch, as implemented on the orchestrator
'       side; equation-service's standalone task is proposed
'       (evilflowers-equation-service#8). Omitted: pump admission, reconcile,
'       SSE (as in sequence-digitalizer-clean-service).
' Source: this repo studio/orchestration/{ledger,contract,appliers}.py,
'         studio/workers/stages/formulas.py (2026-11-16); knowledge#66 and
'         Key-Value (Valkey db 8, 2026-11-16), knowledge#67 (the shared vlm, PaddleOCR-VL).
' =============================================================================

title Formulas stage on equation-service (orchestrator side implemented, 2026-11-16)

participant "Orchestrator\n(job ledger)" as orch <<focus>>
queue "Valkey db 8" as redis
participant "equation-service\n…standalone.formulas" as eq <<proposed>>
participant "vlm\nPaddleOCR-VL" as vlm <<proposed>>
collections "Shared storage\n{storage_root}" as fs

orch -> orch : analyze applied: leaves with reocr regions\nin batches (bulk 32, interactive 1); none: skip
orch -[$accent_msg()]> redis : <b>send_task …standalone.formulas</b>\n<b>regions: key, leaf, image, bbox (fractions), task</b>\n<b>link=job_done · link_error=job_failed</b>
redis -> eq : deliver
eq -> fs : crop the cleaned pages
eq -> vlm : POST /v1/formulas (batches)
vlm --> eq : LaTeX / text
eq -> fs : formulas.json, outcome last
eq -> redis : link: job_done
redis -[$accent_msg()]> orch : <b>job_done</b>
orch -> fs : read formulas.json (only the keys it asked)
orch -> orch : per region still open: judge (fix_latex,\nlooks_hallucinated) -> text or reason;\nan operator's decision is left alone
orch -> fs : after commit: delete the attempt dir

caption The recognizer only answers; the orchestrator judges, so the gate counts every answer the same way. A row the service marks\ndisputed (its render check or cross-check) keeps its text and becomes a disputed region (#6).
footer ELVIRA · FIIT STU · evilflowers-books-digitalizer · docs/diagrams/sequence-digitalizer-formulas-service.puml
@enduml
